  "relicLoreById": "{id, select, compass{Its needle wavers toward places you have never been.} boots{Someone walked a thousand streets in these. Now it's your turn.} lantern{Lit once, it never quite goes out.} staff{Carved with the initials of every owner. There's room for yours.} flask{Always cool, however long the road.} rope{Forty feet of good hemp and a knot no one can untie.} torn_map{Half a city. The other half is out there somewhere.} sea_chart{Coastlines drawn by a sailor who never saw them.} star_chart{Constellations that only appear above unexplored streets.} city_plan{Every alley marked, every name misspelled.} treasure_map{The X keeps moving. Probably on purpose.} nowhere_map{Blank paper that slowly fills as you walk.} watch{Runs fast when you rest and slow when you wander.} spyglass{Look through it and the fog thins a little.} music_box{Plays a tune from the street where it was found.} hourglass{The sand falls upward on long walks.} quill{It draws the roads before you reach them.} snow_globe{A tiny town inside. The lights are on.} moonstone{Glows faintly when the moon is up and you are out.} amber{A tiny map is trapped inside, older than any city.} pearl{Found where a river once ran under the street.} fossil{This was the seabed. Now it's your neighbourhood.} geode{Plain outside, a whole cave of crystals within.} meteorite{Fell from the sky to be found by a walker.} dragon_scale{Warm to the touch. Don't ask where the dragon is.} phoenix_feather{Burns without heat and never turns to ash.} mermaid_comb{Smells of salt, though the sea is far away.} griffin_claw{Points north, as all good griffins do.} unicorn_hair{A single silver strand that hums in the wind.} kraken_ink{Write a street's name in it and you'll never forget the way.} comet_tail{A wisp of light caught on the way past Earth.} star_seed{Plant it in the dark and something will grow.} sun_coin{Minted at noon on the longest day of the year.} moon_key{Opens a door that only exists after midnight.} aurora_ribbon{Green and violet, it moves on its own.} void_pearl{Holds the dark between the stars. The rarest thing a walker finds.} other{}}",
